        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "trigger clause, 便 + consequence",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "便 after a trigger clause introduces its consequence in concise or written narration. Here it is not the adjective convenient.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "他到家，便开始学习。",
                "pinyin": "tā dào jiā ， biàn kāishǐ xuéxí 。",
                "meaning": "As soon as he got home, he began studying.",
                "audio": "aad588ffad9361326874e6c2a59a39ffb3dee614856668641d3b607c4626e250"
              },
              {
                "text": "我听了，便明白了。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ tīng le ， biàn míngbai le 。",
                "meaning": "After hearing it, I understood.",
